<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling gains on dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling gains on dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling edged up on the dollar and British pound on Wednesday, the central Bank of Tanzania (B0T) said.</p>
<p>Against the dollar, the shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 619.2450 compared to Tuesday's rate of 619.7301.</p>
<p>The shilling exchanged at a mean rate of 984.1692 to the pound compared to Tuesday's 984.9402.</p>
</text>
